          "source_bid": "d59f2gonq7sy",
          "details": "丐外，知處州，陛辭，力諫用兵不可太驟。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "office_id": "hiximaqdxpu3",
      "text": "宗正少卿",
      "sources": [
